ke
> >> {la'o cirlrbri. %s .cirlrbri} does pretty good (with some separator wo=
rd
> >> that'd be very unlikely to clash with the name of the browser, unless
> this
> >> latter one is chosen intentionally to clash with the separator).
> >>
> >> Another option could be using something like =C2=AB sisku se pi'o lo s=
